world.mbw

Made with Natural Earth. Free vector and raster map data @ naturalearthdata.com.

world.mbw is encoded from three Natural Earth 1:50m layers (land, coastline, and admin 0
boundary lines on land), version 5.1.2, as published in the nvkelso/natural-earth-vector
repository at tag v5.1.2. Natural Earth is in the public domain; no permission is needed to
use, modify or distribute it. https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/

scripts/build-world-basemap.py writes world.mbw from those files and names their URLs.
